# ==============================================================================
# Parsec Medical DICOM Viewer - .gitignore
# ==============================================================================

# Build & compiler output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio & IDE cache
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# NuGet packages & project caches
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
project.lock.json
project.assets.json

# Installer artifacts & large binaries (GitHub blocks files > 100MB)
Installer/Payload/
Installer/Output/
*.exe
*.rar
*.zip
*.7z
*.msi

# Operating System files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# Temporary & user settings (Secrets, API keys, local configs)
*.tmp
*.bak
*.env
*.key
ai_settings.json
mousesettings.json
pacs_servers.json
custom_references.json

# ==============================================================================
# PROPRIETARY MEDICAL DATA & REFERENCE ASSETS EXCLUSIONS
# The classification diagrams, tables, doctor's reference notes, templates,
# and dictionaries are strictly kept locally and excluded from public git repos.
# ==============================================================================
OpenRadViewer/Assets/*
!OpenRadViewer/Assets/.gitkeep
OpenRadViewer/bosniak_classification.jpg
ReferenceGuides/
